Comment: 0,0:16:33.49,0:16:34.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Comment: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,stuff
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.95,0:00:21.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.79,0:00:23.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.48,0:00:26.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are we getting a Christmas cake from Tirol again this year?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.36,0:00:27.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.01,0:00:29.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Santa's coming, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.43,0:00:30.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.34,0:00:32.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing, Yuzuru?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.30,0:00:34.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm making it so it can hold tons of presents!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.90,0:00:36.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll help out!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.02,0:00:43.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oww...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.62,0:00:47.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.98,0:00:50.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.50,0:02:35.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's a Santa outfit, isn't it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.87,0:02:40.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. Every year, Fujimoto dresses up as Santa.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.61,0:02:43.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No one else here can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.07,0:02:47.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's right. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.65,0:03:00.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder if Fujimoto's mad at me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.17,0:03:02.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Dobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.32,0:03:03.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.37,0:03:05.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There's something more important for you to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.75,0:03:07.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.74,0:03:11.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Candy, dammit! Candy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.42,0:03:13.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.47,0:03:16.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.21,0:03:20.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Domoto!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.10,0:03:24.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I've been waiting. You worn out from staying late at work?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.49,0:03:26.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, I'm fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.85,0:03:31.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll walk you home, if you don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.53,0:03:34.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's... Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.93,0:03:42.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The sparkling lights at Christmas are so wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.04,0:03:47.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're right. Is there anything you want, Kobato?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.80,0:03:49.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Something I want?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.79,0:03:54.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well... Thanks to the bazaar, we were able to buy new toys...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.45,0:04:02.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So I can pick a present I think suits you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.86,0:04:04.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,For me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.21,0:04:06.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, it is Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.56,0:04:10.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder what I should get you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.27,0:04:21.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yo. You're working pretty hard on Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.10,0:04:26.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Whatever. I don't care if it's Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.96,0:04:29.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.48,0:04:30.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.64,0:04:33.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.19,0:04:35.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.11,0:04:42.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.83,0:04:43.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,See you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.38,0:04:56.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato, haven't you made up with Kiyokazu yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.64,0:05:02.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I think he really hates me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.17,0:05:06.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He's acting different from normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.70,0:05:09.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He doesn't tease me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.86,0:05:11.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He won't even look straight at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.33,0:05:13.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.27,0:05:17.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I've been so worried about it...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.70,0:05:26.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's not your fault, Kobato. I'm sure Kiyokazu doesn't blame you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.74,0:05:30.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He just can't tell you up front.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.11,0:05:34.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.27,0:05:38.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.41,0:05:44.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.28,0:05:44.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No prob.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.67,0:05:48.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wanna get together tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.96,0:05:50.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.74,0:05:51.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All right, I'll be waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.25,0:05:53.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right in front of the nursery.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.52,0:05:56.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But you'll get cold!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.92,0:05:57.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll be waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.99,0:06:00.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.80,0:06:02.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.29,0:06:06.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All right, see you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.48,0:06:09.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.51,0:06:16.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's Christmassy at home!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.26,0:06:20.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I've got to get you a present, Ioryogi!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.13,0:06:21.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What would you like?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.52,0:06:24.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A bottle full of candy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.01,0:06:25.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,O{\fscx162}-{\fscx81}Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.34,0:06:30.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, that's right! I made this for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.65,0:06:31.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.60,0:06:37.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Now you're a reindeer!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.58,0:06:43.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Dobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.15,0:06:49.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh man.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.46,0:07:03.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm gonna be late!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.35,0:07:05.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.11,0:07:07.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.52,0:07:10.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're up earlier than usual, Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.47,0:07:13.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, we have to get ready for the Christmas party.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.75,0:07:14.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.20,0:07:18.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato, you should come over to our place if you don't have anything planned.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.71,0:07:20.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We're having a Christmas party.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.36,0:07:22.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Mama's gonna cook something tasty!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.92,0:07:24.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You should come if you have time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.40,0:07:26.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Of course! Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.59,0:07:38.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.04,0:07:39.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.32,0:07:43.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto, you should come to our Christmas party too!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.43,0:07:46.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I have to work tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.69,0:07:48.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Plus, Christmas is...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.46,0:07:53.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Work hard, okay? See you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.61,0:08:01.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All right, you two need to get going too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.61,0:08:02.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.62,0:08:03.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.13,0:08:11.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.79,0:08:14.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone has so much fun at Christmas...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.15,0:08:17.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's just Fujimoto that seems so sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.25,0:08:22.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I really must have done something to set him off.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.92,0:08:26.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's not it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.54,0:08:35.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kiyokazu has been alone ever since that Christmas Eve.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.50,0:09:30.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.92,0:09:38.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.84,0:09:41.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay, boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.18,0:09:46.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.73,0:09:48.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Very well, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.73,0:10:35.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kiyokazu's mother never came back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.83,0:10:43.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Just after than, Sayaka's father took him in.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.43,0:11:14.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry I'm late.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.49,0:11:15.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.76,0:11:18.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All right, let's start the Christmas party.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.89,0:11:20.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.22,0:11:25.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Come in when everyone calls for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.09,0:11:26.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.16,0:11:29.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.02,0:11:29.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.50,0:11:31.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Get changed, and let's get started.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.29,0:11:46.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.78,0:11:51.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto's so mature...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.24,0:11:53.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.30,0:11:56.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So, so mature...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.60,0:12:03.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll try my best too!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.31,0:12:17.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There, there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.05,0:12:22.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, let's all call for Santa!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.57,0:12:24.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.09,0:12:26.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Santa!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.66,0:12:29.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Santa!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.94,0:12:31.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's Santa!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.15,0:12:32.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Santa!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.12,0:12:34.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Santa's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.38,0:12:35.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Santa!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.90,0:12:42.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait, are you just Mister Kiyokazu?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.43,0:12:46.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, it's Santa!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.24,0:12:47.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Santa?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.78,0:12:49.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is it Mister Kiyokazu?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.19,0:12:53.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This is Santa!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.55,0:12:57.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Aren't you Santa, Santa?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.48,0:13:04.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder what presents we're all getting from Santa?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.09,0:13:08.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Presents from Santa!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.99,0:13:11.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A present for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.85,0:13:14.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.05,0:13:15.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.17,0:13:17.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you, Santa!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.41,0:13:20.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All right, it's time for the cake!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.54,0:13:31.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oof!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.96,0:13:34.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Time to go get my present.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.13,0:13:48.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Good work, Fujimoto.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.95,0:13:54.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll clean up. Cheer up, it's Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.14,0:13:55.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Quit worrying about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.16,0:14:26.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Man, why me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.37,0:14:29.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shut up. Christmas is rush season.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.78,0:14:31.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're overworking me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.35,0:14:33.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Merry Christmas!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.51,0:14:36.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.42,0:14:40.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That doesn't suit you at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.89,0:14:50.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.45,0:14:56.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.44,0:15:10.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I see. Kiyokazu is so distant because it's Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.58,0:15:16.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I think I've hurt him even worse now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.46,0:15:22.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He hates me even more now...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.62,0:15:24.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.09,0:15:28.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's{\fscx162}-{\fscx81}!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.09,0:15:31.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why does it hurt this much!?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.27,0:15:45.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're that worried about Kiyokazu?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.68,0:15:50.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can't stop thinking of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.12,0:15:56.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know why, but my heart aches every time I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.76,0:16:00.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.34,0:16:07.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Domoto?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.82,0:16:13.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I know what the best present for you is now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.27,0:16:24.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.26,0:16:32.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I have a Christmas present.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.05,0:16:36.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't get me wrong, it's not for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.94,0:16:40.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato's at the outlook. Bring this to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.56,0:16:44.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Go for it, I'll cover for you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.68,0:16:47.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait, why me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.29,0:16:51.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She's awfully sad for Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.31,0:16:53.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So{\fscx162}-{\fscx81}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.20,0:16:55.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're hurting her!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.87,0:17:01.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But she thinks it's her own fault...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.77,0:17:04.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She wants to apologize to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.48,0:17:09.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato's waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.75,0:17:12.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She's waiting alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.57,0:18:11.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.78,0:18:13.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's not your fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.82,0:18:17.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You didn't do anything wrong. You don't need to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.03,0:18:22.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So quit worrying.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.82,0:18:30.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Does this mean you're not mad?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.09,0:18:34.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Haven't I been telling you that this whole time!?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.36,0:18:36.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Now you're mad!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.11,0:18:43.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Anyway, please don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.94,0:18:47.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.82,0:18:51.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's right. Domoto sent this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.24,0:18:59.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Umm...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.00,0:19:02.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You've made up, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.59,0:19:05.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This is my present to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.20,0:19:07.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry if he's mean to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.77,0:19:11.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Merry Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.53,0:19:17.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're my present from Domoto?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.27,0:19:20.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What did Domoto even say to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.19,0:19:23.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"I have the perfect present for you, Kobato. Let me go get it."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.32,0:19:33.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Domoto let me make up with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.02,0:19:36.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That son of a...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.42,0:19:39.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.30,0:19:42.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's snowing, Fujimoto!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.31,0:19:44.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.67,0:19:45.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's so pretty!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.87,0:20:05.45,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,The flowers which blossom in spring
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.81,0:20:12.40,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Are plucked in the summer sun
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.69,0:20:18.91,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Within my heart
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.44,0:20:25.72,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Their shine remains
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.40,0:20:39.71,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Even on days I close my windows to shut out the morning rain
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.09,0:20:53.77,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Fluttering within my heart, the light breaks through the clouds
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.94,0:21:08.89,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Joy and sadness, I embrace them both and keep going
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.65,0:21:23.38,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,My hand and yours join together strongly
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.24,0:22:14.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The snow is really pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.62,0:22:17.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.66,0:22:34.79,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,A faraway voice leads me on
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.25,0:22:42.23,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Like it's smiling, like it's singing
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.23,0:22:49.35,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,The echoing sound of the wind
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.70,0:22:28.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No matter what happens, once winter's over and spring comes...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.82,0:22:32.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I say goodbye to Kobato.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:04.33,0:01:07.21,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,{95 after the first frame of ribbon}What shall I do?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:07.21,0:01:15.51,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Even the obvious things are always so hard
Dialogue: 1,0:01:15.51,0:01:25.31,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,I just want to grin when I'm happy, sing when I'm in love
Dialogue: 1,0:01:26.81,0:01:31.11,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,They say my dreams will come true someday
Dialogue: 1,0:01:32.11,0:01:38.86,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,but when will someday come? I can't wait!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:38.86,0:01:44.54,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Count one, two, three and spread my arms
Dialogue: 1,0:01:44.54,0:01:49.75,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Gather the light to myself
Dialogue: 1,0:01:49.75,0:01:56.05,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Where is it? Tell me what I can do
Dialogue: 1,0:01:56.05,0:02:01.72,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Even if I'm hurt so much, even if I run so hard
Dialogue: 1,0:02:01.72,0:02:08.44,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Even if I collapse crying over and over, I still
Dialogue: 1,0:02:08.44,0:02:17.15,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,believe in my amazing future
Dialogue: 1,0:02:55.48,0:03:01.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(500,1125)\pos(360,166)\c&HFFFFFF&}... White Christmas.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:00.98,0:23:08.15,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,{14 into ED}People all want to fly
Dialogue: 1,0:23:09.82,0:23:15.66,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,but they're cheated by gravity
Dialogue: 1,0:23:16.25,0:23:23.67,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,everyone can really fly
Dialogue: 1,0:23:26.26,0:23:32.30,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,She must be so unhappy because
Dialogue: 1,0:23:33.64,0:23:43.31,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,she forgot her own shadow somewhere
Dialogue: 1,0:23:43.69,0:23:46.03,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Then...
Dialogue: 1,0:23:46.57,0:23:54.45,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,If you tell me "thanks", if you say "thanks" and smile
Dialogue: 1,0:23:54.45,0:24:01.54,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Going back and forth, we'll be happy
Dialogue: 1,0:24:02.33,0:24:11.05,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,You'll be happy, there'll be nothing to worry about
Dialogue: 1,0:24:11.13,0:24:15.22,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,As long as we're together
Dialogue: 1,0:24:16.93,0:24:28.36,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,It's strange, I'm crying even though I'm happy
Dialogue: 1,0:24:25.36,0:24:30.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(500,0)\pos(458,388)}... The Wanderer.
Dialogue: 1,0:24:25.36,0:24:30.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(500,0)\pos(456,116)}Next episode
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.84,0:08:59.10,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,{\bord0\shad0\c&H363A48&\frz355.125\pos(315,150)}To Mommy
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.98,0:23:03.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
